    {
      "text": "The Activities page within the SaaS Security Report page shows the data for all the activities performed in various SaaS applications. This data helps in tracking specific activities and view the users who performed the activities for further analysis and action."
    },
    {
      "text": "The Activities page provides the following benefits and enables you to:"
    },
    {
      "item": "View an audit trail of all the activities end users and admins perform in SaaS applications. Activities include uploading, downloading, sharing documents, downloading a report, etc.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "View granular activities for both the user and administrator, filtered by activity types, SaaS tenants, etc.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "heading": "About the Activities Page",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "On the Activities page (Data Security > DSPM > Activities), you can do the following:"
    },
    {
      "item": "Filter SaaS Activities using the following filters and click Apply to update the page with your selections. You can click Reset at any time:",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          61,
          66
        ],
        [
          122,
          127
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Tenant: Filter by the name of the SaaS application tenant.",
      "depth": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          6
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Activity: Filter by the type of activities the end users perform:",
      "depth": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          8
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "The Activity filter is currently not supported for the Smartsheet application.",
      "depth": 1
